<Mod id="0ba6de75-d016-4e5e-955b-d8e1e154b839" version="12">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Madoka Magica Civilization Pack -- Rebellion [BNW]</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds eight Civilizations based off of the animated series Puella Magi Madoka Magica, and its movie sequel, Rebellion.</Teaser>
    <Description>Adds eight Civilizations based off of the animated series Puella Magi Madoka Magica, and its movie sequel, Rebellion. Requires Gods &amp; Kings and/or Brave New World.</Description>
    <Authors>Vicevirtuoso</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Deliverator, whoward69, Nomad or What, hazel16, pazyryk, DarkScythe, the translator anon in the 2ch Civ mod thread</SpecialThanks>
